Do not use:

- Neon colours or glow effects.
- Glassmorphism.
- Blurred gradient blobs.
- Galaxy, cyberpunk or aurora themes.
- Gradient text.
- Excessive shadows.
- Emoji as interface icons.
- AI-generated UI artwork.
- Generic centred-hero landing pages.
- Rounded cards for absolutely everything.
- Generic template-looking dashboards.
- Gratuitous animation.
- Fake browser chrome inside the application.

Use solid colour fields and a restrained, coherent design system.

Use rounded corners where they serve a purpose. Avoid making every element a floating pill or oversized card.

Create a layout with visual rhythm. Different sections should have their own hierarchy instead of placing every element inside an identical white rectangle.

